{"id":"nabor","lemma":"набор","pos":"noun","rank":1715,"glosses":["set, kit, outfit, collection (collection of various objects for a particular purpose, such as a set of tools)","font type case containing movable type","typesetting, composition"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%80.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%80.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"набора","plural":"наборы"},"examples":[{"text":"Наконец-то я получил весь набор!","en":"I've finally got the whole set!","words":[{"g":"at last, finally"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to receive, to get","l":"получить"},{"g":"all"},null]},{"text":"Мне нужен набор первой помощи.","en":"I need a first aid kit.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null,null,{"g":"help, assistance, aid","l":"помощь"}]},{"text":"Не хватает пятого тома из этого набора.","en":"The fifth volume of this set is missing.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to grasp","l":"хватать"},null,{"g":"volume","l":"том"},{"g":"from / out of"},null,null]},{"text":"Не одолжите мне набор инструментов?","en":"Could you please lend me a toolbox?","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to lend","l":"одолжить"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null]},{"text":"Мне нужен шахматный набор.","en":"I want a chess set.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null,null]}]}